  <h2>Personalized reactivation for your practice</h2>
  <p>
    Every practice has a different patient mix. ChiroCandy builds campaigns around your
    database size, patient demographics, and the services you want to promote.
  </p>

  <h2>Why inactive patients stop coming in</h2>
  <p>
    Patients leave for many reasons. They feel better and forget maintenance care. Life gets
    busy. They move across town. They had a single issue resolved and never planned follow
    up visits. Some simply need a reminder that ongoing care supports long-term health.
  </p>
  <p>
    Reactivation messaging addresses each scenario with the right tone. A patient who
    completed a pain relief plan gets different outreach than someone who moved and found a
    new provider.
  </p>

  <h2>How reactivation fits your overall marketing plan</h2>
  <p>
    New patient ads fill the top of your funnel. SEO and social media build ongoing
    visibility. Reactivation works the bottom of the funnel by converting patients you
    already paid to acquire. Together, these channels create a complete growth system.
  </p>
  <p>
    Practices that reactivate even 5 to 10 percent of an inactive list often see a
    meaningful bump in monthly visits without increasing ad spend.
  </p>

  <h2>What results to expect from reactivation campaigns</h2>
  <p>
    Results depend on database size, how long patients have been inactive, and offer
    strength. Most practices see the first wave of responses within days of the initial
    email. Follow-up sequences capture patients who need more than one touchpoint.
  </p>
  <p>
    We track open rates, click rates, and booked appointments so you know exactly what the
    campaign produced.
  </p>

  <h2>Why choose ChiroCandy for reactivation</h2>
